#: data/text/match_call.inc:1
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText1"
msgid ""
"Hi! {PLAYER}{KUN}, hello!\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I saw this {STR_VAR_2} a while back\n"
"but I couldn't catch it.\p"
"It was so close, too!\n"
"Well, see you again!$"
msgstr ""
"嗨！{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"刚才我看到了一只{STR_VAR_2}，\n"
"可是没能抓到它。\p"
"就差那么一点点！\n"
"那么，下次再聊！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:9
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText2"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"It's {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I tried to catch a nice {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"a little while ago.\p"
"But, it got away.\n"
"I was sure disappointed!\p"
"Okay, bye!$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"刚才我想抓一只\n"
"很棒的{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"可是它逃走了。\n"
"真是太失望了！\p"
"好了，拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:18
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText3"
msgid ""
"Hey there, {PLAYER}!\n"
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I just took a shot at catching\n"
"this {STR_VAR_2}, but it took off.\p"
"I came oh so close, too!\p"
"It spoiled my day…\n"
"All right, see you!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}！\n"
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"我刚才想抓这只{STR_VAR_2}，\n"
"结果它跑掉了。\p"
"明明就差一点点！\p"
"今天真是倒霉……\n"
"好了，回头见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:27
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText4"
msgid ""
"Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} here.\p"
"You know the POKéMON {STR_VAR_2}?\n"
"I came close to getting one.\p"
"It was just a while back.\n"
"I thought I had it but it escaped.\p"
"If I see it again, I'll get it for\n"
"sure, though.\p"
"Okay, catch you later.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你知道{STR_VAR_2}这种宝可梦吗？\n"
"我差点就抓到一只了。\p"
"就在刚才。\n"
"我以为抓到了，结果它逃了。\p"
"不过下次再遇到的话，\n"
"我一定会抓到它。\p"
"好了，回头聊。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:38
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText5"
msgid ""
"Hiya, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"It's {STR_VAR_1}.\l"
"Catching any POKéMON lately?\p"
"A little while ago I came close to\n"
"nabbing one, but it got loose.\p"
"Right, take care!$"
msgstr ""
"哈喽，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"最近有抓到宝可梦吗？\p"
"刚才我差点就抓到一只，\n"
"结果被它溜掉了。\p"
"好了，保重哦！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:46
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText6"
msgid ""
"Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} here.\l"
"Caught any POKéMON lately?\p"
"I nearly nabbed one the other day.\n"
"But it evaded me somehow.\p"
"You take care.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"最近有抓到宝可梦吗？\p"
"前几天我差点就抓到一只了。\n"
"可不知怎么就被它躲开了。\p"
"你多保重。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:54
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText7"
msgid ""
"…Uh, {PLAYER}{KUN}?\n"
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Oh, wait! Wait!\n"
"I can catch this {STR_VAR_2}…\p"
"Aaarrrgh! It bolted loose!\n"
"That wasn't just close!$"
msgstr ""
"……呃，{PLAYER}{KUN}？\n"
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"啊，等等！等一下！\n"
"我能抓住这只{STR_VAR_2}……\p"
"啊啊啊！它挣脱逃走了！\n"
"这可不只是差一点啊！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:62
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText8"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, how do you do?\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1} speaking.\p"
"Have you had success catching\n"
"POKéMON lately?\p"
"I came very close a little while\n"
"ago, but my target got free.\p"
"I need to try harder!\n"
"See you again!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好吗？\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你最近抓宝可梦\n"
"顺利吗？\p"
"刚才我差一点就成功了，\n"
"可是目标逃走了。\p"
"我得更加努力才行！\n"
"下次再聊！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:72
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText9"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, hi there!\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"So? Are you getting more POKéMON\n"
"together?\p"
"I'm having a rotten time of it!\n"
"They all get away from me!\p"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}，嗨！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"怎么样？你的宝可梦\n"
"收集得越来越多了吗？\p"
"我可惨了！\n"
"它们全都从我手里逃走了！\p"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:81
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText10"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, hello…\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Listen, I came within a whisker of\n"
"catching this {STR_VAR_2}…\p"
"But, it gave me the slip…\p"
"I need to try harder.\n"
"See you around.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好……\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"跟你说，我差一点点\n"
"就抓到这只{STR_VAR_2}了……\p"
"可还是被它溜走了……\p"
"我得更加努力才行。\n"
"回头见。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:90
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText11"
msgid ""
"Ah, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\l"
"How are things with you?\p"
"I tried to catch a wild {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"earlier, but it managed to flee.\p"
"I feel defeated…$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"你最近怎么样？\p"
"刚才我想抓野生的{STR_VAR_2}，\n"
"结果还是让它逃掉了。\p"
"我好挫败啊……$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:98
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText12"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\l"
"Are you still catching POKéMON?\p"
"I've been trying to catch them\n"
"myself, but it's not so easy.\p"
"The way of POKéMON is deep!$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"你还在抓宝可梦吗？\p"
"我自己也一直在试着抓，\n"
"可是没那么容易。\p"
"宝可梦之道真是深奥啊！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:106
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText13"
msgid ""
"Ah, hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}!\l"
"Have you been catching POKéMON?\p"
"I've been trying to catch them\n"
"myself, but with little success.\p"
"The way of POKéMON is deep!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\l"
"你最近有在抓宝可梦吗？\p"
"我自己也一直在试着抓，\n"
"可是几乎没成功过。\p"
"宝可梦之道真是深奥啊！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:114
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText14"
msgid ""
"Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}, how do you do?\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Just now, I tried to catch a cute\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"It got away, though!\n"
"Oh, you bet I was disappointed!\p"
"Bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，嗨，{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好吗？\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"刚才我想抓一只\n"
"可爱的{STR_VAR_2}。\p"
"可是它逃走了！\n"
"你猜得没错，我失望极了！\p"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:123
msgctxt "MatchCall_WildBattleText15"
msgid ""
"Hey, {PLAYER}!\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"I've been thinking about trying\n"
"to catch me some POKéMON.\p"
"But I can't seem to find any.\n"
"It's a real puzzler for me!\p"
"I'm at my wit's end!\n"
"See you around!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"我一直在想\n"
"要不要去抓几只宝可梦。\p"
"可是怎么也找不到。\n"
"真是让我想不通啊！\p"
"我已经无计可施了！\n"
"回头见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:133
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText1"
msgid ""
"Hi! {PLAYER}{KUN}, hello!\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I tried battling another TRAINER,\n"
"but I lost.\p"
"It was really disappointing.\n"
"Well, see you again!$"
msgstr ""
"嗨！{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"我和别的训练家对战了，\n"
"结果输了。\p"
"真是太让人失望了。\n"
"那么，下次再聊！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:141
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText2"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"It's {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I challenged someone else after\n"
"we battled.\p"
"I came close, but I ended up\n"
"losing. Oh, well!$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"和你对战之后，\n"
"我又去挑战了别人。\p"
"差一点就赢了，\n"
"可最后还是输了。唉，算了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:149
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText3"
msgid ""
"Hey there, {PLAYER}!\n"
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I just got cleaned in a battle.\p"
"I guess I need to raise my team\n"
"some more!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}！\n"
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"我刚刚在对战中被打得落花流水。\p"
"看来我得再好好\n"
"培养我的队伍了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:156
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText4"
msgid ""
"Hey, {PLAYER}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} here.\p"
"I tried another battle yesterday,\n"
"but I couldn't pull out the win.\p"
"My team needs more raising.\n"
"Okay, catch you later.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"昨天我又对战了一场，\n"
"可惜没能赢下来。\p"
"我的队伍还需要多加培养。\n"
"好了，回头聊。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:164
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText5"
msgid ""
"Hiya, {PLAYER}!\n"
"It's {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"How are things with you?\p"
"I've been battling on,\n"
"but I haven't won very often.\p"
"I can't get it together.\n"
"Right, take care!$"
msgstr ""
"哈喽，{PLAYER}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你最近怎么样？\p"
"我一直在对战，\n"
"可是很少能赢。\p"
"总是发挥不好。\n"
"好了，保重哦！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:173
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText6"
msgid ""
"Hey, {PLAYER}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} here.\p"
"How's it going for you?\p"
"I've been battling hard lately,\n"
"but to little success.\p"
"I can't get into the groove.\n"
"You take care.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你最近过得怎么样？\p"
"我最近一直在拼命对战，\n"
"可是没什么成果。\p"
"怎么也找不到状态。\n"
"你多保重。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:182
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText7"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} here.\n"
"How's it going lately?\p"
"I lost a battle yesterday,\n"
"and it's filled my thoughts.\p"
"I have to devise a plan…\n"
"See you.$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"最近怎么样？\p"
"我昨天输了一场对战，\n"
"脑子里全是那场对战。\p"
"我得想个办法才行……\n"
"再见。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:190
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText8"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, how do you do?\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1} speaking.\p"
"How are your POKéMON doing?\n"
"I lost a match the other day.\p"
"I need to try harder!\n"
"See you again!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好吗？\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你的宝可梦还好吗？\n"
"前几天我输了一场比赛。\p"
"我得更加努力才行！\n"
"下次再聊！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:198
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText9"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, hi there!\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"Listen, listen, you have to hear\n"
"this!\p"
"I had a POKéMON battle earlier,\n"
"but I lost at the last second.\p"
"Oh, it burns me up!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}，嗨！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"听我说，听我说，\n"
"你一定要听听这件事！\p"
"刚才我进行了宝可梦对战，\n"
"结果在最后一刻输掉了。\p"
"哎呀，气死我了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:207
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText10"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, hello…\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"A little earlier, I was in a battle.\n"
"I lost, though.\p"
"I need to raise my POKéMON more.\n"
"See you around.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好……\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"刚才我进行了一场对战。\n"
"不过输了。\p"
"我得把宝可梦培养得更强才行。\n"
"回头见。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:215
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText11"
msgid ""
"Ah, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\l"
"How are your POKéMON?\p"
"I just lost yet another battle.\p"
"Well, see you!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"你的宝可梦还好吗？\p"
"我刚刚又输了一场对战。\p"
"那么，再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:222
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText12"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\l"
"Are you still battling hard?\p"
"As for me, I lost recently, so I've\n"
"been training my team all over.\p"
"Let's meet again.$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"你还在努力对战吗？\p"
"我最近输了一场，\n"
"所以一直在重新训练队伍。\p"
"我们再见面吧。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:230
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText13"
msgid ""
"Ah, hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"I hope you've been keeping well.\p"
"I was in a battle just a little\n"
"while before this.\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, try to be active like me.\n"
"See you again!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"希望你一切都好。\p"
"就在打电话之前，\n"
"我刚进行了一场对战。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，你也要像我\n"
"一样积极哦。下次再聊！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:239
msgctxt "MatchCall_NegativeBattleText14"
msgid ""
"Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Are you doing good?\p"
"You should go home every so often,\n"
"though.\p"
"Bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，嗨，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你过得好吗？\p"
"不过你也要时不时\n"
"回家看看哦。\p"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:247
msgctxt "MatchCall_PositiveBattleText1"
msgid ""
"Hi! {PLAYER}{KUN}, hello!\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"I battled another TRAINER earlier.\n"
"I won! I won!\p"
"My {STR_VAR_2} really worked hard\n"
"for me. This is so great!$"
msgstr ""
"嗨！{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"刚才我和别的训练家对战了。\n"
"我赢了！我赢了！\p"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}真的很努力。\n"
"太棒了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:255
msgctxt "MatchCall_PositiveBattleText2"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"It's {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"I had a battle yesterday and\n"
"I won! It's fantastic!$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"我昨天对战了一场，\n"
"而且赢了！太棒了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:261
msgctxt "MatchCall_PositiveBattleText3"
msgid ""
"Hey there, {PLAYER}!\n"
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}!\l"
"How's your battling?\p"
"Me, I had a battle the other day,\n"
"and my {STR_VAR_2} came up huge!\p"
"The next time I battle you,\n"
"{PLAYER}, it won't be me losing!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}！\n"
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}！\l"
"你对战得怎么样？\p"
"我前几天对战了一场，\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}表现超棒！\p"
"下次和你对战的时候，\n"
"{PLAYER}，输的可不会是我！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:270
msgctxt "MatchCall_PositiveBattleText4"
msgid ""
"Hey, {PLAYER}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} here.\p"
"I had a match earlier.\n"
"I managed to win, but it was close.\p"
"My {STR_VAR_2} put on one\n"
"inspired showing.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"刚才我比了一场。\n"
"总算赢了，不过很险。\p"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"表现得非常出色。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:278
msgctxt "MatchCall_PositiveBattleText5"
msgid ""
"Hiya, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"It's {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"How are things with you?\n"
"Battling much?\p"
"I just won a while back!\n"
"My {STR_VAR_2} was brilliant!\p"
"You wait. I'm going to beat you\n"
"next time! Right, take care!$"
msgstr ""
"哈喽，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你最近怎么样？\n"
"常常对战吗？\p"
"我刚才赢了一场！\n"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}太出色了！\p"
"你等着吧，下次我要打败你！\n"
"好了，保重哦！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:288
msgctxt "MatchCall_PositiveBattleText6"
msgid ""
"Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} here.\p"
"How's it going for you?\p"
"I've been riding a hot streak.\n"
"Why, I just won a battle.\p"
"When we have our next battle,\n"
"I'm sure not going to lose!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
