"你的宝可梦还好吗？\p"
"我的宝可梦越来越强了。\n"
"我想让你看看，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p"
"我现在在{STR_VAR_2}附近，\n"
"你离得近的话就来对战吧。\p"
"希望很快能见到你！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:590
msgctxt "MatchCall_DifferentRouteBattleRequestText10"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, hello…\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\l"
"So, how are things with you?\p"
"My POKéMON have grown much\n"
"stronger than before.\p"
"I'd love another battle with you,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"I'll be around {STR_VAR_2}.\n"
"Come see me if you're close.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好……\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"你最近怎么样？\p"
"我的宝可梦\n"
"比以前强多了。\p"
"我很想再和你对战一场，\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p"
"我会在{STR_VAR_2}附近。\n"
"离得近的话就来找我吧。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:601
msgctxt "MatchCall_DifferentRouteBattleRequestText11"
msgid ""
"Ah, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\l"
"Where might you be now?\p"
"My POKéMON are full of life.\n"
"They appear to be looking forward\l"
"to seeing your POKéMON, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"I'm around {STR_VAR_2} now.\n"
"I hope you'll seek us out.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"你现在在哪儿呢？\p"
"我的宝可梦充满了活力。\n"
"它们好像很期待\l"
"见到你的宝可梦，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p"
"我现在在{STR_VAR_2}附近。\n"
"希望你来找我们。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:611
msgctxt "MatchCall_DifferentRouteBattleRequestText12"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I should tell you, my POKéMON have\n"
"grown to be quite robust lately.\p"
"I would like to see them in a battle\n"
"with you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"We'll be around {STR_VAR_2}.\n"
"Come see us anytime!$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"跟你说，我的宝可梦\n"
"最近变得相当强壮了。\p"
"我想看看它们\n"
"和你对战的样子，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p"
"我们会在{STR_VAR_2}附近。\n"
"随时来找我们吧！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:621
msgctxt "MatchCall_DifferentRouteBattleRequestText13"
msgid ""
"Ah, hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}!\l"
"Are your POKéMON keeping well?\p"
"My POKéMON have been so healthy,\n"
"they don't look capable of losing!\p"
"I would surely love to have another\n"
"battle with you.\p"
"If you're near {STR_VAR_2},\n"
"do come see us.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\l"
"你的宝可梦还好吗？\p"
"我的宝可梦健康得很，\n"
"看起来根本不可能输！\p"
"我真的很想\n"
"再和你对战一场。\p"
"如果你在{STR_VAR_2}附近，\n"
"一定要来找我们哦。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:632
msgctxt "MatchCall_DifferentRouteBattleRequestText14"
msgid ""
"Oh, hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\l"
"Keeping well, I hope.\p"
"Oh, yes! My POKéMON are\n"
"much stronger than before.\p"
"Don't you think we ought to have\n"
"a battle, {PLAYER}{KUN}?\p"
"We'll be waiting for you around\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"Come see us anytime, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，嗨，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"希望你一切都好。\p"
"对了！我的宝可梦\n"
"比以前强多了。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，你不觉得\n"
"我们应该对战一场吗？\p"
"我们会在{STR_VAR_2}附近\n"
"等你。\p"
"随时来找我们，好吗？$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:644
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText1"
msgid ""
"It's me, the mountain-loving\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"Well, since we met, have you grown\n"
"to appreciate the mountains more?\p"
"I rarely see you in the mountains…\p"
"Next time, we'll meet somewhere\n"
"around {STR_VAR_2}.$"
msgstr ""
"是我，最爱登山的\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"怎么样，认识我以后，\n"
"你有没有更喜欢山了？\p"
"我很少在山里见到你……\p"
"下次我们就在\n"
"{STR_VAR_2}附近见吧。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:653
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText2"
msgid ""
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"Hello.\p"
"I was just telling a new TRAINER\n"
"about you.\p"
"I told her about a strong TRAINER\n"
"who raises POKéMON with care.\p"
"I hope you'll become a TRAINER\n"
"that everyone will admire.\p"
"I hope we meet again!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"你好。\p"
"我刚刚还在跟一位新训练家\n"
"聊起你呢。\p"
"我跟她说，有一位很强的训练家\n"
"总是用心培育宝可梦。\p"
"希望你能成为\n"
"人人都敬仰的训练家。\p"
"希望我们还能再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:664
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText3"
msgid ""
"Hello! It's {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I love where I am now.\n"
"It's pleasant with sweet aromas!\p"
"I think someone planted BERRIES,\n"
"and they burst into bloom.\p"
"See you again sometime!$"
msgstr ""
"你好！我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"我好喜欢现在待的地方。\n"
"到处都是甜甜的香味，好舒服！\p"
"好像有人种了树果，\n"
"现在都开满了花。\p"
"下次再聊吧！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:672
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText4"
msgid ""
"Hello! Thirty years of exploration,\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} at your service!\p"
"It seems that you're energetically\n"
"traveling here and there.\p"
"Have you discovered any new ruins?\n"
"Please tell if you have!\p"
"Now, if you'll excuse me,\n"
"I have ruins to explore.$"
msgstr ""
"你好！探险三十年的\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}为你效劳！\p"
"看来你正精力充沛地\n"
"四处旅行呢。\p"
"你发现什么新的遗迹了吗？\n"
"有的话请告诉我！\p"
"好了，恕我失陪，\n"
"我还有遗迹要去探索。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:682
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText5"
msgid ""
"It's {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"Know what I'm doing today?\n"
"Looking at waves from the beach!\p"
"Sigh… The waves are all sparkly.\n"
"The sea is the prettiest from here.\l"
"I'm getting hungry, so bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"你知道我今天在做什么吗？\n"
"在海滩上看海浪！\p"
"唉……海浪闪闪发光的。\n"
"从这里看，大海最美了。\l"
"我肚子饿了，拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:690
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText6"
msgid ""
"Munch-chew…\n"
"Oh, hi, it's {STR_VAR_1}.\l"
"I love eating on the beach.\p"
"My POKéMON and I have been doing\n"
"great. We're fully fueled!\l"
"I'm going for a swim. Bye!$"
msgstr ""
"嚼嚼，咕嘟……\n"
"啊，嗨，我是{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"我最喜欢在海滩上吃东西了。\p"
"我和我的宝可梦都过得很好。\n"
"能量全满！\l"
"我要去游泳了。拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:698
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText7"
msgid ""
"Hello, this is {STR_VAR_1}…\p"
"I've grown a little jaded with this\n"
"whole COOLTRAINER thing…\p"
"Everyone thinks I'm a perfect\n"
"TRAINER, and that makes me try to\l"
"live up to that expectation.\p"
"But I guess that goes with being\n"
"a COOLTRAINER.\p"
"I'll just have to buckle down…\n"
"and grin and bear it.\p"
"You're the only person that I could\n"
"confide in like this.\p"
"But when I see you next,\n"
"don't worry, I won't whine!$"
msgstr ""
"你好，我是{STR_VAR_1}……\p"
"我对精英训练家这个身份\n"
"有点厌倦了……\p"
"大家都觉得我是完美的训练家，\n"
"所以我总想努力\l"
"不辜负这份期待。\p"
"不过，这大概就是\n"
"精英训练家的宿命吧。\p"
"我只能打起精神……\n"
"咬牙坚持下去。\p"
"能让我这样倾诉的，\n"
"只有你一个人。\p"
"不过下次见面的时候，\n"
"放心，我不会再发牢骚了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:714
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText8"
msgid ""
"Yahoo, it's {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"How do you do?\p"
"I've been raising my POKéMON with\n"
"you as the target.\p"
"I don't intend to lose when we\n"
"battle again.\p"
"Isn't it great to have TRAINER\n"
"friends? Let's meet again!$"
msgstr ""
"呀呼，我是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"你好吗？\p"
"我一直以你为目标\n"
"培育我的宝可梦。\p"
"下次对战的时候，\n"
"我可不打算输。\p"
"有训练家朋友真好啊！\n"
"我们再见吧！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:724
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText9"
msgid ""
"It's {STR_VAR_1}…\n"
"Right now, behind you…\l"
"Wasn't there something…?\p"
"The power of the POKéMON that\n"
"sleep here at MT. PYRE…\p"
"It's telling me about you…\p"
"You should walk away quickly and\n"
"never once look back…\p"
"Giggle…\n"
"Farewell…$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}……\n"
"就在现在，你的身后……\l"
"是不是有什么东西……？\p"
"沉睡在送神山的\n"
"宝可梦的力量……\p"
"正在告诉我关于你的事……\p"
"你最好赶快离开，\n"
"千万不要回头……\p"
"嘻嘻……\n"
"永别了……$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:736
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText10"
msgid ""
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"How do you do?\p"
"Isn't it convenient that we can\n"
"chat like this at a distance?\p"
"Before, if I wanted to speak with\n"
"anyone, I had to have my father\l"
"drive me…\p"
"I should be going now.\n"
"I'm glad we had this chat.$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"你好吗？\p"
"能像这样隔着很远聊天，\n"
"是不是很方便呢？\p"
"以前我想找人说话的时候，\n"
"都得让爸爸开车\l"
"送我过去……\p"
"我该走了。\n"
"很高兴能和你聊天。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:747
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText11"
msgid ""
"It's {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"Will you listen to this?\p"
"I like the SAFARI ZONE a lot,\n"
"but whenever I go, I get lost!\p"
"All that tall grass!\n"
"And it's much too spread out!\p"
"I feel better getting that off\n"
"my chest!\p"
"I'm off to the SAFARI ZONE again!\n"
"Catch you!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"你听我说好不好？\p"
"我很喜欢狩猎地带，\n"
"可是每次去都会迷路！\p"
"到处都是高高的草丛！\n"
"而且地方也太大了！\p"
"说出来心里舒服多了！\p"
"我又要去狩猎地带了！\n"
"回头见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:759
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText12"
msgid ""
"Hello, {STR_VAR_1} here.\n"
"Yes, correct, I am rich, yes.\p"
"I should tell you, my wealth has\n"
"grown since we last met.\p"
"What's more, my POKéMON have also\n"
"grown stronger.\p"
"I can't shake the feeling that\n"
"this world exists for me!\p"
"Oh, no need to say a word!\n"
"Everyone knows it's true!\p"
"Oh, you must excuse me, I have this\n"
"formal dinner to attend.$"
msgstr ""
"你好，我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"没错，正是如此，我很有钱。\p"
"我得告诉你，自从上次见面后，\n"
"我的财富又增加了。\p"
"不仅如此，\n"
"我的宝可梦也变强了。\p"
"我总觉得\n"
"这个世界就是为我而存在的！\p"
"哦，你什么都不用说！\n"
"大家都知道这是事实！\p"
"哦，失陪了，\n"
"我还得去参加正式的晚宴。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:773
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText13"
msgid ""
"Ufufufufu…\n"
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}…\p"
"Can you guess what I'm seeing?\n"
"A pair of {STR_VAR_2} in a battle.\p"
"Maybe I'll try catching the winner…\n"
"Ufufufufufu…\p"
"I… I'm kind of busy now.\n"
"I have to go.$"
msgstr ""
"呜呼呼呼呼……\n"
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}……\p"
"你猜得到我在看什么吗？\n"
"两只{STR_VAR_2}在对战。\p"
"也许我会去抓赢的那只……\n"
"呜呼呼呼呼呼……\p"
"我……我现在有点忙。\n"
"先挂了。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:783
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText14"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"I was just thinking I'm getting\n"
"bored of the ABANDONED SHIP.\p"
"But since I'm already here,\n"
"and I want to beat you once,\l"
"I'll be sticking around a bit more.\p"
"If you feel compelled, why don't\n"
"you come see me?\p"
"I think today will be the day that\n"
"I finally challenge the man next\l"
"door to a match.\p"
"Be seeing you!$"
msgstr ""
"哦，是我，{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"我刚刚还在想，\n"
"我已经有点厌倦弃船了。\p"
"不过既然都来了，\n"
"而且我还想赢你一次，\l"
"就再多待一会儿吧。\p"
"如果你有兴趣，\n"
"不如来找我吧？\p"
"我觉得今天就是我\n"
"终于向隔壁的大叔\l"
"发起挑战的日子。\p"
"回头见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:797
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText15"
msgid ""
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"The man of the sea!\p"
"You know what I think?\p"
"The TRAINERS out at sea are\n"
"the toughest of the tough!\p"
"You should learn from me and train\n"
"in the sea…\p"
"Whoops, giant surf rising!\p"
"It's a great training opportunity!\n"
"Sorry, but I have to go!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"大海的男子汉！\p"
"你知道我是怎么想的吗？\p"
"在海上的训练家\n"
"才是强中之强！\p"
"你应该向我学习，\n"
"到海上去训练……\p"
"哎呀，大浪打过来了！\p"
"这可是训练的好机会！\n"
"抱歉，我得走了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:809
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText16"
msgid ""
"It's {STR_VAR_1}! Listen, I've been\n"
"teaching karate to my POKéMON.\p"
"But now they're better than me!\n"
"I've done nothing but lose to them!\p"
"But even though I may lose to\n"
"POKéMON, I won't lose to another\l"
"TRAINER, no sir!\p"
"We have to battle again!\n"
"Ugwaah!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！听我说，\n"
"我一直在教我的宝可梦空手道。\p"
"可现在它们比我还厉害了！\n"
"我一直都在输给它们！\p"
"不过就算会输给宝可梦，\n"
"我也绝不会输给\l"
"别的训练家！\p"
"我们一定要再战一场！\n"
"呜哇啊！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:820
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText17"
msgid ""
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"How're your travels unwinding?\p"
"…Whoa, is that right?\n"
"Sounds awfully stimulating!\p"
"I think I could write a song about\n"
"one of your episodes.\p"
"…Oh, hey, I'm feeling it.\n"
"I hear the riffs in my head.\p"
"I'd better get this tune properly\n"
"written, so I've got to fly! Later!$"
msgstr ""
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"你的旅行进展得怎么样？\p"
"……哇，真的吗？\n"
"听起来超刺激的！\p"
"我觉得我可以把你的\n"
"某段经历写成一首歌。\p"
"……哦，嘿，来感觉了。\n"
"旋律在我脑海里响起来了。\p"
"我得赶紧把这首曲子\n"
"好好写下来，先走了！回见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:832
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText18"
msgid ""
"This is {STR_VAR_1}…\n"
"Hear my new song.\p"
"Lalala, {STR_VAR_2}, {STR_VAR_2}!\n"
"Why are you that {STR_VAR_2}?\l"
"Why can't I be you, {STR_VAR_2}?\l"
"Lala, {STR_VAR_2} and {STR_VAR_1},\l"
"{STR_VAR_1} and {STR_VAR_2}…\p"
"Repeat chorus, fade…$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}……\n"
"来听听我的新歌吧。\p"
"啦啦啦，{STR_VAR_2}，{STR_VAR_2}！\n"
"你为什么是{STR_VAR_2}？\l"
"我为什么不能是{STR_VAR_2}？\l"
"啦啦，{STR_VAR_2}和{STR_VAR_1}，\l"
"{STR_VAR_1}和{STR_VAR_2}……\p"
"重复副歌，渐弱……$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:842
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText19"
msgid ""
"I'm {STR_VAR_1}, you know,\n"
"the camping expert!\p"
"When we battled, I couldn't help\n"
"but lose to you.\p"
"After all, my expertise is in\n"
"camping.\p"
"But win or lose, I like to battle\n"
"when I'm camping.\p"
"Battle with us again, okay?\n"
"Oh, and let's go camping, too!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}，你知道的，\n"
"露营专家！\p"
"我们对战的时候，\n"
"我只能输给你。\p"
"毕竟，我的专长\n"
"是露营嘛。\p"
"不过不管输赢，\n"
"我都喜欢在露营时对战。\p"
"再和我们对战吧，好吗？\n"
"哦，还有一起去露营吧！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:854
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText20"
msgid ""
"It's me, me, {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"I'd like to climb other mountains\n"
"than this one, to be honest.\p"
"But I'm not sure if there'd be any\n"
"ladies like on MT. CHIMNEY.\p"
"If you know any other mountain\n"
"with ladies around, let me know!\p"
"Ehehehe, see you around!$"
msgstr ""
"是我，是我，{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"说实话，除了这座山，\n"
"我还想去爬别的山。\p"
"不过我不确定那里会不会有\n"
"像烟囱山这样的姑娘。\p"
"如果你知道哪座山上\n"
"有姑娘的话，告诉我一声！\p"
"嘿嘿嘿，回头见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:864
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText21"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\l"
"It's {STR_VAR_1}…\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\l"
"That's all today…$"
msgstr ""
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\l"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}……\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\l"
"今天就这些……$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:872
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText22"
msgid ""
"This is {STR_VAR_1}. Today, I had\n"
"this feeling I would chat with you.\p"
"My desire to defeat you builds\n"
"by day and by night.\p"
"You have a rival like that, yes?\n"
"I wish it were me…\p"
"I'm glad you heard me out.\n"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。今天我就有种\n"
"预感，会和你聊天。\p"
"想打败你的心情\n"
"日日夜夜都在增长。\p"
"你也有那样的对手吧？\n"
"我希望那个人是我……\p"
"谢谢你听我说完。\n"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:882
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText23"
msgid ""
"It's {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"When there's a strong TRAINER\n"
"nearby, I can sometimes sense that\l"
"somehow.\p"
"Did you pass close by, {PLAYER}{KUN}?\n"
"Maybe it was you.\p"
"I'll be waiting for your visit.\n"
"Bye!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"附近有强大的训练家时，\n"
"我有时候能隐约\l"
"感觉得到。\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，你刚才从附近经过了吗？\n"
"说不定那就是你。\p"
"我会等你来的。\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:892
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText24"
msgid ""
"Hello, this is {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"You sound well, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"I've traveled around the world,\n"
"but I must say I've taken a great\l"
"shine to this region.\p"
"I plan to stay here a while.\n"
"Perhaps we can meet again?\p"
"I've not forgotten your dazzling\n"
"techniques.\p"
"I do hope for a rematch.$"
msgstr ""
"你好，我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"听起来你很精神嘛，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\p"
"我周游过世界各地，\n"
"不过不得不说，\l"
"我非常喜欢这个地区。\p"
"我打算在这里待一阵子。\n"
"也许我们还能再见？\p"
"我还没忘记你那\n"
"令人眼花缭乱的技巧。\p"
"真希望能再战一场。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:904
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText25"
msgid ""
"Snivel… It's… {STR_VAR_1}…\n"
"…Sob…\p"
"ROXANNE chewed me out in class\n"
"today.\p"
"But I don't dislike her or anything.\p"
"ROXANNE tells me exactly what\n"
"I did wrong so I can learn from it.\p"
"You bet I'll be going to\n"
"the TRAINER'S SCHOOL tomorrow!\p"
"See you later!$"
msgstr ""
"呜呜……我是……{STR_VAR_1}……\n"
"……呜……\p"
"今天上课的时候，\n"
"杜娟老师把我训了一顿。\p"
"不过我一点也不讨厌她。\p"
"杜娟老师会准确地告诉我\n"
"哪里做错了，好让我学到东西。\p"
"我明天当然还会去\n"
"训练家学校！\p"
"回头见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:916
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText26"
msgid ""
"It's {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"ROXANNE let me battle with her\n"
"yesterday.\p"
"The results…\n"
"Terrible, like you needed to ask.\p"
"But I was delighted that ROXANNE\n"
"would even let me challenge her!\p"
"You wouldn't believe how much\n"
"more I admire her!\p"
"I'm going to really focus and work!\n"
"I'd better go!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"昨天杜娟老师\n"
"让我和她对战了。\p"
"结果嘛……\n"
"不用问也知道，惨败。\p"
"不过杜娟老师愿意让我挑战她，\n"
"我就已经很高兴了！\p"
"你都想象不到\n"
"我现在有多崇拜她！\p"
"我要好好集中精神努力！\n"
"我得走了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:929
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText27"
msgid ""
"Hi, it's ANNA! I'm with my junior\n"
"partner MEG again today.\p"
"I really love caring for MEG and\n"
"POKéMON. They're so cute!\p"
"I wish I could look after them\n"
"as if they were my siblings!\p"
"Oh, hi, MEG!\n"
"Did you get the buns?\p"
"Huh? No, no, I'm not treating you\n"
"like my personal slave!\p"
"You lost the match, so you have\n"
"to go buy the bread as punishment!\p"
"I wouldn't treat you like a slave,\n"
"MEG! You're too special to me!\p"
"I have to go now.\n"
"It's time for our snack!$"
msgstr ""
"嗨，我是安娜！今天我又和\n"
"学妹梅格在一起。\p"
"我真的很喜欢照顾梅格\n"
"和宝可梦。她们太可爱了！\p"
"真希望能把她们\n"
"当成自己的妹妹来照顾！\p"
"啊，嗨，梅格！\n"
"面包买回来了吗？\p"
"咦？不不不，我才没有\n"
"把你当成我的跑腿小妹！\p"
"你比赛输了，所以作为惩罚，\n"
"要去买面包嘛！\p"
"我才不会把你当跑腿的呢，\n"
"梅格！你对我来说太特别了！\p"
"我得挂了。\n"
"吃点心的时间到了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:947
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText28"
msgid ""
"I love POKéMON!\n"
"It's {STR_VAR_1} from the FAN CLUB!\p"
"You have to hear this!\n"
"My sweet POKéMON…\p"
"Snort! Wahaha!\n"
"I can't say any more! It's a secret!\l"
"It's just too cute for words!\p"
"Oh, my sweet {STR_VAR_2} is begging\n"
"for a {POKEBLOCK}!\p"
"It's the picture of cuteness!\p"
"Sorry, but I can't talk now!\n"
"You'll have to hear this next time!$"
msgstr ""
"我爱宝可梦！\n"
"我是爱好者俱乐部的{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"你一定要听听这个！\n"
"我那可爱的宝可梦……\p"
"噗！哇哈哈！\n"
"我不能再说了！这是秘密！\l"
"可爱到无法用语言形容！\p"
"哦，我可爱的{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"在跟我要宝可方块呢！\p"
"简直就是可爱的化身！\p"
"抱歉，我现在不能聊了！\n"
"下次再告诉你吧！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:961
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText29"
msgid ""
"Ohoho!\p"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}! I can't wait to\n"
"tell you about my darling POKéMON!\p"
"Please, you must listen to this.\n"
"It's about my darling {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"Whenever anyone picks it up,\n"
"it leaps straight into my arms!\p"
"Oh… Oh… Could there be anything\n"
"more blissful?\p"
"Oh, it feels so heavenly!\p"
"I'm so glad I could share some of\n"
"my happiness with you.\p"
"Well, I must be going.\n"
"Bye, now!$"
msgstr ""
"哦呵呵！\p"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！我等不及要跟你\n"
"说说我心爱的宝可梦了！\p"
"拜托，你一定要听听。\n"
"是关于我心爱的{STR_VAR_2}的。\p"
"每当有人把它抱起来，\n"
"它就会直接跳进我的怀里！\p"
"哦……哦……还有什么\n"
"比这更幸福的事吗？\p"
"哦，简直就像在天堂一样！\p"
"真高兴能和你\n"
"分享我的幸福。\p"
"好了，我该走了。\n"
"再见啦！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:977
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText30"
msgid ""
"I am… {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"People call me an EXPERT.\p"
"But there is one thing I know.\n"
"I could not be an EXPERT on my own\l"
"power.\p"
"Only with the help of POKéMON can\n"
"a TRAINER become an EXPERT.\p"
"Humph! I believe I may have said\n"
"something deep and profound!\p"
"I shall leave you in good spirits!$"
msgstr ""
"我是……{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"人们称我为达人。\p"
"但我明白一件事。\n"
"仅凭我自己的力量，\l"
"是成不了达人的。\p"
"只有借助宝可梦的力量，\n"
"训练家才能成为达人。\p"
"哼！我好像说了\n"
"一番很有深度的话！\p"
"我就带着好心情告辞了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:989
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText31"
msgid ""
"It's {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"I'm glad to chat with you!\p"
"I am feeling alive and refreshed\n"
"soaking in this hot-spring tub.\p"
"I've been battling young TRAINERS\n"
"since we met, but you're still\l"
"the best of the lot.\p"
"I imagine you'll become an EXPERT\n"
"in your old age! Ohohoho…$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"很高兴能和你聊天！\p"
"泡在温泉池里，\n"
"我感觉神清气爽、活力满满。\p"
"认识你以后，我和很多\n"
"年轻训练家对战过，\l"
"但你依然是最出色的。\p"
"我想你老了以后\n"
"一定会成为达人的！哦呵呵呵……$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1000
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText32"
msgid ""
"Yay! This is {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"What's up?\p"
"I might be imagining this, but when\n"
"I win battles, my shorts seem to\l"
"feel, like, better. Materially.\p"
"What do I mean by that?\n"
"It's kind of hard to explain, but…\l"
"How would I say this now…\l"
"My shorts feel silkier!\p"
"And when I battled you, {PLAYER}{KUN},\n"
"my shorts felt icky and coarse.\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"You didn't really believe that?\l"
"Ehehehe, that's all! Bye now!$"
msgstr ""
"耶！我是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"最近怎么样？\p"
"也许是我的错觉，\n"
"每当我赢了对战，\l"
"我的短裤好像，嗯，手感变好了。\p"
"我这么说是什么意思呢？\n"
"有点难解释啦，不过……\l"
"该怎么说呢……\l"
"我的短裤会变得更丝滑！\p"
"而跟你对战的时候，{PLAYER}{KUN}，\n"
"我的短裤变得又黏又粗糙。\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"你不会真的信了吧？\l"
"嘿嘿嘿，就这些！拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1016
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText33"
msgid ""
"Ahoy!\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} here!\p"
"As always, I'm fishing with wild\n"
"abandon!\p"
"Are there other places I can fish\n"
"than the sea and rivers?\p"
"I get these powerful urges to\n"
"fish just about anywhere!\p"
"Oh, gosh, darn it!\n"
"My line's tangled up!\p"
"Gotta go!\n"
"Find me some new fishing spots!$"
msgstr ""
"喂喂！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"我还是一如既往地\n"
"尽情钓鱼！\p"
"除了大海和河流，\n"
"还有别的地方能钓鱼吗？\p"
"我总有一股冲动，\n"
"想在任何地方钓鱼！\p"
"哎呀，糟糕！\n"
"我的鱼线缠在一起了！\p"
"我得走了！\n"
"帮我找找新的钓鱼地点吧！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1030
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText34"
msgid ""
"Hey, there! It's {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"Are you taking it casually?\p"
"Ever since I was a kid, you know,\n"
"I've always been placid, huh?\p"
"I never was much for getting all\n"
"stressed or rushing things.\p"
"But wouldn't you know it,\n"
"I'm now a TRIATHLETE.\p"
"You just can't tell where life will\n"
"take you, if you get my drift.\p"
"You're a TRAINER now, but who\n"
"knows what the future holds, huh?\p"
"Imagine yourself as a teacher,\n"
"or maybe an artist. Cool, huh?\p"
"But, hey, be cool. Take it casual.\n"
"See you around.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，你好！我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"你有放轻松吗？\p"
"我从小就是\n"
"很悠闲的性格，对吧？\p"
"我从来都不喜欢\n"
"紧张兮兮或者匆匆忙忙。\p"
"可是你猜怎么着，\n"
"我现在成了铁人三项运动员。\p"
"人生会把你带到哪里，\n"
"谁也说不准，你懂我意思吧。\p"
"你现在是训练家，不过\n"
"谁知道未来会怎样呢？\p"
"想象一下自己当老师，\n"
"或者当艺术家。很酷吧？\p"
"不过，嘿，放轻松。别着急。\n"
"回头见。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1048
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText35"
msgid ""
"This is {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"I'm cycling right now.\p"
"I love swimming and running,\n"
"but cycling is my first love!\p"
"It makes my whole body feel as if\n"
"I'm one with the wind.\p"
"It exhilarates me as if I were\n"
"flying!\p"
"Okay! Today, I'm going to set a new\n"
"CYCLING ROAD record!\p"
"You should make the challenge, too!\n"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"我正在骑自行车。\p"
"我喜欢游泳和跑步，\n"
"但骑车才是我的最爱！\p"
"骑车让我觉得\n"
"整个人都和风融为一体了。\p"
"那种兴奋就像\n"
"在天上飞一样！\p"
"好！今天我要创造\n"
"自行车道的新纪录！\p"
"你也来挑战一下吧！\n"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1062
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText36"
msgid ""
"Yo, this is {STR_VAR_1}! I'm smack\n"
"in the middle of a triathlon!\p"
"But, hey, I've always got time to\n"
"shoot the breeze!\p"
"Working out with POKéMON feels\n"
"mighty good!\p"
"Without exchanging words, we synch\n"
"as if we shared a heart.\p"
"It's inspiring!\p"
"Gasp… Chatting while running…\n"
"I'm getting run down…\l"
"Gasp… Have…to…go…$"
msgstr ""
"哟，我是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"我正在参加铁人三项比赛！\p"
"不过，嘿，\n"
"闲聊的时间我总是有的！\p"
"和宝可梦一起锻炼\n"
"感觉超级棒！\p"
"不用言语交流，我们也能\n"
"心意相通，合为一体。\p"
"真是激励人心啊！\p"
"呼……边跑边聊天……\n"
"我快没力气了……\l"
"呼……我得……挂了……$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1076
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText37"
msgid ""
"Hi, it's {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"If you want to improve endurance,\l"
"high-altitude training is it!\p"
"Try running on a mountaintop.\n"
"You'll be gasping in no time!\p"
"I'm getting oxygen starved, too!\n"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""
"嗨，我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"要想提高耐力，\l"
"高原训练是最好的！\p"
"试试在山顶上跑步吧。\n"
"你很快就会喘不过气来！\p"
"我也快缺氧了！\n"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1085
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText38"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's {STR_VAR_1}, hello.\p"
"I've been swimming a lot but I still\n"
"can't seem to reach EVERGRANDE.\p"
"Maybe I'm just going in circles.\p"
"No, no, that can't be possible.\n"
"Wahahaha.\l"
"Take care!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，我是{STR_VAR_1}，你好。\p"
"我游了很久很久，\n"
"可还是游不到彩幽市。\p"
"也许我只是在原地绕圈。\p"
"不不不，那是不可能的。\n"
"哇哈哈哈。\l"
"保重！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1094
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText39"
msgid ""
"Hey, it's {STR_VAR_1}…\n"
"Whoops!\p"
"Splash!\p"
"Blug-blug-blug-blug…\p"
"Sploosh!\p"
"Whiff-whiff! Whiff-whiff!\p"
"Hey! Sorry about that!\n"
"I just put on some suntan oil.\p"
"So my POKéNAV went whoopsy\n"
"out of my hand into the water!\p"
"But, boy, DEVON's POKéNAV is built\n"
"tough. It survived that dunking!\p"
"Anyways, I'm busy sunbathing,\n"
"so let's chat another time.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，我是{STR_VAR_1}……\n"
"哎呀！\p"
"扑通！\p"
"咕噜咕噜咕噜咕噜……\p"
"哗啦！\p"
"呼哧呼哧！呼哧呼哧！\p"
"嘿！刚才不好意思！\n"
"我刚抹了防晒油。\p"
"结果宝可导航\n"
"从手里滑进水里了！\p"
"不过，哇，得文的宝可导航\n"
"真结实。泡了水都没坏！\p"
"总之，我正忙着晒太阳，\n"
"我们下次再聊吧。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1110
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText40"
msgid ""
"Hello, this is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Out of the three triathlon events,\n"
"I like swimming best.\p"
"But if I stay in the sea too long,\n"
"won't I get all prune-like?\p"
"Ooh, triathlon is such a grueling\n"
"test of human endurance! Bye!$"
msgstr ""
"你好，我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"铁人三项的三个项目里，\n"
"我最喜欢游泳。\p"
"可是在海里待太久的话，\n"
"皮肤会不会变得皱巴巴的？\p"
"哦，铁人三项真是对人类耐力的\n"
"严酷考验啊！拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1119
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText41"
msgid ""
"Hello, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} here.\p"
"How are your POKéMON doing?\p"
"My DRAGON POKéMON appear to be\n"
"in peak form. Bye for now.$"
msgstr ""
"你好，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你的宝可梦还好吗？\p"
"我的龙宝可梦看起来\n"
"状态正好。先这样吧。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1126
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText42"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} here.\p"
"My {STR_VAR_2} has grown even more\n"
"tough than that last time.\p"
"I'm not going to lose again to you.\n"
"You wait till next time!\p"
"See you around!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"比上次更强了。\p"
"我不会再输给你了。\n"
"你就等着下次吧！\p"
"回头见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1134
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText43"
msgid ""
"It is {STR_VAR_1} here.\p"
"I have continued with my studies\n"
"in the art of concealment.\p"
"But I have been too successful.\n"
"No one has been able to find me.\l"
"My success makes me lonely…\p"
"Like smoke I disappear!\n"
"Farewell!$"
msgstr ""
"在下是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"在下一直在继续\n"
"钻研隐身之术。\p"
"可是太成功了。\n"
"没有一个人能找到在下。\l"
"成功让在下好寂寞……\p"
"如烟般消失吧！\n"
"告辞！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1144
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText44"
msgid ""
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"I kept up my training since we met.\p"
"My {STR_VAR_2} is getting pretty\n"
"tough.\p"
"Training on a beach is effective,\n"
"just as I thought. Bye now!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"认识你以后，我一直坚持训练。\p"
"我的{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"变得相当强了。\p"
"果然和我想的一样，\n"
"在海滩上训练很有效。拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1152
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText45"
msgid ""
"How do you do?\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I wonder when this yucky volcanic\n"
"ash will stop falling?\p"
"If it gets too deep, it will cover\n"
"up the pattern on my parasol…\p"
"Let's promise to meet again!$"
msgstr ""
"你好吗？\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"这讨厌的火山灰\n"
"什么时候才会停呢？\p"
"积得太厚的话，\n"
"会把我阳伞上的花纹盖住的……\p"
"我们约好再见面吧！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1161
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText46"
msgid ""
"Hi, {STR_VAR_1} here.\p"
"Did you know that it's easier to\n"
"float in the sea than a pool?\p"
"Just by lying still, your body will\n"
"float on its own.\p"
"But if you float for too long,\n"
"watch that you don't get carried\l"
"off too far out.\p"
"…Where am I, anyway?\n"
"I'd better go!$"
msgstr ""
"嗨，我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你知道吗？在海里\n"
"比在泳池里更容易浮起来。\p"
"只要静静地躺着，\n"
"身体就会自己浮起来。\p"
"不过浮太久的话，\n"
"要小心别被冲到\l"
"太远的地方去。\p"
"……话说，我这是在哪儿？\n"
"我得走了！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1173
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText47"
msgid ""
"Oh, {PLAYER}{KUN}, hello!\n"
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\l"
"I'm up in the mountains now.\p"
"But the ground is too bumpy.\n"
"I can't pitch my tent here…\p"
"Oh, I had a brilliant idea!\p"
"Maybe I can get my POKéMON to tamp\n"
"the ground flat here!\p"
"I'm going to try that!\n"
"Bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，{PLAYER}{KUN}，你好！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\l"
"我现在在山上。\p"
"可是地面太凹凸不平了。\n"
"没法在这里搭帐篷……\p"
"啊，我想到一个好主意！\p"
"也许可以让我的宝可梦\n"
"把这里的地面踩平！\p"
"我去试试看！\n"
"拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1185
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText48"
msgid ""
"Oh, hi, hi, this is {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"I'm raising POKéMON with LIV!\n"
"We're trying very hard!\p"
"If we try harder, can we become\n"
"number one? Bye-bye!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，嗨嗨，我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"我正在和莉芙一起培育宝可梦！\n"
"我们很努力哦！\p"
"再努力一点的话，\n"
"我们能成为第一吗？拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1192
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText49"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} here!\p"
"I'm a SAILOR, but I'm not on a boat\n"
"now.\p"
"It makes me wonder--what should\n"
"a SAILOR on land be called?\p"
"That's what I've been thinking\n"
"while staring out across the waves.\p"
"All right, next time!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"我是水手，可我现在\n"
"并不在船上。\p"
"这让我不禁思考——\n"
"在陆地上的水手该叫什么呢？\p"
"我一边眺望着海浪，\n"
"一边想着这个问题。\p"
"好了，下次再聊！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1202
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText50"
msgid ""
"It's {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"So? Get any more POKéMON?\p"
"If you catch a new POKéMON,\n"
"you have to come show me.\p"
"I won't whine for it, honest.\n"
"I'll be waiting. See you.$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"怎么样？又抓到宝可梦了吗？\p"
"如果你抓到新的宝可梦，\n"
"一定要来给我看看。\p"
"我保证不会吵着要的。\n"
"我等你。再见。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1210
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText51"
msgid ""
"This is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Are you raising your POKéMON\n"
"in the optimal way?\p"
"The air is clean where I am.\n"
"It's the perfect environment for\l"
"raising POKéMON.\p"
"If you're going to focus on raising\n"
"POKéMON, you should come out to\l"
"{STR_VAR_2}. Take care now.$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你有用最好的方法\n"
"培育你的宝可梦吗？\p"
"我这里空气很清新。\n"
"是培育宝可梦的\l"
"完美环境。\p"
"如果你想专心培育宝可梦，\n"
"就该来{STR_VAR_2}看看。\l"
"保重哦。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1221
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText52"
msgid ""
"Hi, this is {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I gave a {POKEBLOCK} to my {STR_VAR_2}.\n"
"It seemed to enjoy it very much.\p"
"It looks like POKéMON have their\n"
"likes and dislikes with {POKEBLOCK}S.\p"
"I find that quite fascinating.\n"
"Please do take care.$"
msgstr ""
"嗨，我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"我喂{STR_VAR_2}吃了宝可方块。\n"
"它好像很喜欢呢。\p"
"看来宝可梦对宝可方块\n"
"也有自己的喜好。\p"
"我觉得这真有意思。\n"
"请多保重。$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1230
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText53"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} here.\p"
"If you cooperate with POKéMON,\n"
"one can be comfortable in the wild.\p"
"Everyone should realize that and\n"
"cooperate with POKéMON more.\p"
"That would be ideal.\n"
"I really think so.\p"
"I think you're on the right track!\n"
"Catch you later!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"只要和宝可梦合作，\n"
"在野外也能过得很舒适。\p"
"大家都应该明白这一点，\n"
"多和宝可梦合作。\p"
"那样就太理想了。\n"
"我真的这么想。\p"
"我觉得你走的路是对的！\n"
"回头见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1241
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText54"
msgid ""
"Hi, it's {STR_VAR_1}. You know,\n"
"the TRAINER who's always prepared!\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, do you have enough items?\n"
"Are your POKéMON fit for action?\p"
"Keeping everything perfect around\n"
"you all the time is the secret to\l"
"keeping your journey going.\p"
"I'd better go check my own\n"
"supplies! Be vigilant!$"
msgstr ""
"嗨，我是{STR_VAR_1}。你知道的，\n"
"就是那个总是有备无患的训练家！\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，你的道具够用吗？\n"
"宝可梦能随时上阵吗？\p"
"时刻把身边的一切\n"
"都准备妥当，\l"
"是让旅途持续下去的秘诀。\p"
"我得去检查一下自己的\n"
"补给了！要时刻警惕哦！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1252
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText55"
msgid ""
"It's {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"It's {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"{STR_VAR_2} is a very busy\n"
"thoroughfare, so I get challenged\l"
"by all kinds of TRAINERS every day.\p"
"Today, I won five battles and lost\n"
"only three!\p"
"How did you do today?\n"
"Tell me about it next time, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"{STR_VAR_2}来往的人很多，\n"
"所以我每天都会被\l"
"各种训练家挑战。\p"
"今天我赢了五场，\n"
"只输了三场！\p"
"你今天表现得怎么样？\n"
"下次告诉我吧，好吗？$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1263
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText56"
msgid ""
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I'm popular because I have lots\n"
"of BUG POKéMON, right?\p"
"Well, I took a bunch of my fave\n"
"bugs to school today.\p"
"This girl I like started crying!\n"
"Go ahead and laugh if you want.\p"
"I have to try teaching her what\n"
"makes BUG POKéMON so appealing.\p"
"Snivel…\n"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"我有好多虫属性宝可梦，\n"
"所以很受欢迎，对吧？\p"
"今天我带了一大堆\n"
"心爱的虫子去学校。\p"
"结果我喜欢的那个女孩哭了！\n"
"想笑就笑吧。\p"
"我得想办法让她明白\n"
"虫属性宝可梦的魅力。\p"
"呜呜……\n"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1276
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText57"
msgid ""
"Hah! Hah! Hah! Hah!\p"
"Hi! It's {STR_VAR_1}! Hah! Hah!\p"
"Trying to chat…\n"
"While climbing…\l"
"Is harsh exercise… Hah! Hah!\p"
"Urgh! Oof…\n"
"It's steeper now…\l"
"We'll chat…another time…\l"
"Hah! Hah! Hah!$"
msgstr ""
"呼！呼！呼！呼！\p"
"嗨！我是{STR_VAR_1}！呼！呼！\p"
"一边爬山……\n"
"一边聊天……\l"
"是很辛苦的运动……呼！呼！\p"
"呃！唔……\n"
"现在更陡了……\l"
"我们……下次再聊……\l"
"呼！呼！呼！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1287
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText58"
msgid ""
"Oh, hi!\p"
"I'm still searching for treasures\n"
"with KIRA!\p"
"Maybe there isn't any treasure\n"
"here at all…\p"
"But the important thing is for me\n"
"to search alongside KIRA.\p"
"Oh, hey, KIRA!\n"
"Wh-why are you angry?\p"
"I'm not ignoring you, honey!\n"
"You're my one and only!\p"
"…{PLAYER}, I have to go, bye!$"
msgstr ""
"啊，嗨！\p"
"我还在和绮拉一起\n"
"寻找宝藏！\p"
"也许这里根本\n"
"就没有宝藏……\p"
"不过重要的是\n"
"能和绮拉一起寻找。\p"
"哦，嘿，绮拉！\n"
"你、你为什么生气了？\p"
"亲爱的，我没有不理你！\n"
"你是我的唯一！\p"
"……{PLAYER}，我得挂了，拜拜！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1301
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText59"
msgid ""
"This is {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"I went to DEWFORD's GYM again\n"
"for training.\p"
"BRAWLY, the GYM LEADER, seems\n"
"to be tougher now.\p"
"Something about being toughened\n"
"by the wild waves…\p"
"But he's still as cool as ever.\n"
"The ladies adore him!\l"
"It makes me envious, frankly.\p"
"I wonder… Is his friend BRUNO\n"
"the same way as BRAWLY?\p"
"You know, all sweaty or smelly,\n"
"and prone to calling people\l"
"“big wave,” that sort of thing.\p"
"But, hey, this jealousy thing isn't\n"
"very seemly, is it?\p"
"Forget this chat ever happened,\n"
"how about it? So long!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"我又去武斗镇的道馆\n"
"训练了。\p"
"道馆馆主藤树\n"
"好像变得更强了。\p"
"说是被狂野的海浪\n"
"锻炼出来的……\p"
"不过他还是一样那么酷。\n"
"女孩子们都很崇拜他！\l"
"说实话，我好羡慕啊。\p"
"我在想……他的朋友希巴\n"
"是不是也跟藤树一样？\p"
"你知道的，满身大汗或者有点臭，\n"
"还喜欢把人叫作\l"
"“大浪”之类的。\p"
"不过，嘿，这样嫉妒别人\n"
"可不太好，对吧？\p"
"就当这次通话没发生过，\n"
"好不好？再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1322
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText60"
msgid ""
"It's a pleasure to chat with\n"
"a young TRAINER like you.\p"
"I imagine that you will continue to\n"
"enjoy POKéMON whatever your age.\p"
"Wouldn't it be good if you had\n"
"a partnership like ours?\p"
"Of course, {PLAYER}{KUN}, you already\n"
"enjoy the trust and companionship\l"
"of your POKéMON now.\p"
"You have the makings of long and\n"
"enduring relationships already!\p"
"Hahaha!\n"
"Never be discouraged!$"
msgstr ""
"能和你这样的年轻训练家\n"
"聊天，真是荣幸。\p"
"我想不管你到了什么年纪，\n"
"都会继续享受宝可梦的乐趣。\p"
"要是你也能有像我们这样的\n"
"伙伴关系，那该多好啊！\p"
"当然，{PLAYER}{KUN}，你现在\n"
"就已经得到了宝可梦的\l"
"信任和陪伴。\p"
"你已经具备了建立\n"
"长久关系的潜质！\p"
"哈哈哈！\n"
"千万不要气馁哦！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1337
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText61"
msgid ""
"Hi, this is {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"We just won a battle!\p"
"We don't win often, but it was this\n"
"cool SWIMMER guy.\p"
"My sister was steamed!\p"
"She wanted to pretend that she\n"
"was weak to make an impression!\p"
"She always chews me out whether\n"
"we win or lose!\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, can you say something\n"
"to her next time?\p"
"Okay, see you!$"
msgstr ""
"嗨，我是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"我们刚刚赢了一场对战！\p"
"我们很少能赢，\n"
"这次的对手是个很酷的游泳小哥。\p"
"我姐姐气坏了！\p"
"她本来想装作很弱，\n"
"好给对方留个好印象！\p"
"不管我们是赢是输，\n"
"她总是会骂我！\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}，下次你能不能\n"
"帮我跟她说说？\p"
"好了，再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1351
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText62"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1} here, yes.\n"
"I headed out to sea yesterday.\p"
"I had been hoping to find a new\n"
"ruin to explore.\p"
"But the tides somehow seemed to\n"
"carry me back where I started.\p"
"I'm still weak at battling, too…\n"
"Feel free to mock me…\l"
"But I won't give up.\p"
"My day will come when I discover\n"
"a new ruin!\p"
"That's all I have to say!\n"
"Farewell for now!$"
msgstr ""
"是的，我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"我昨天出海了。\p"
"我本来希望能找到\n"
"新的遗迹去探索。\p"
"可是潮水不知怎么的，\n"
"又把我送回了起点。\p"
"我对战也还是很弱……\n"
"想嘲笑我就嘲笑吧……\l"
"不过我不会放弃的。\p"
"等我发现新遗迹的那一天，\n"
"就是我扬眉吐气的时候！\p"
"我要说的就这些！\n"
"暂且告辞！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1366
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText63"
msgid ""
"Ahoy there!\n"
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}!\l"
"I'm out on ROUTE 108 now!\l"
"In other words, where I always am!\p"
"Today, a gorgeous SWIMMER \n"
"swam by me!\p"
"So I startled her with a shout!\p"
"And she gave me a nasty glare!\p"
"That's all from ROUTE 108!\n"
"Brought to you by {STR_VAR_1}!$"
msgstr ""
"喂喂！\n"
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}！\l"
"我现在在108号水路！\l"
"也就是说，老地方！\p"
"今天，有一位漂亮的游泳美女\n"
"从我身边游过！\p"
"于是我大喊一声吓了她一跳！\p"
"结果她狠狠地瞪了我一眼！\p"
"以上是来自108号水路的报道！\n"
"由{STR_VAR_1}为您播报！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1378
msgctxt "MatchCall_PersonalizedText64"
msgid ""
"It's {STR_VAR_1}!\p"
"I'm kind of busy, but I figured\n"
"I should let you know that I've\l"
"beaten five TRAINERS again today.\p"
"If I keep this pace up, I can\n"
"probably beat you next time.\p"
"I think we'll be good rivals,\n"
"you and I. Good-bye for now!$"
msgstr ""
"我是{STR_VAR_1}！\p"
"我现在有点忙，不过我想\n"
"还是该告诉你一声，\l"
"我今天又打败了五个训练家。\p"
"照这个势头下去，\n"
"下次我大概就能赢你了。\p"
"我觉得我们会成为很好的对手，\n"
"你和我。那么，再见啦！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1388
msgctxt "MatchCall_BattleFrontierStreakText1"
msgid ""
"Hi! This is {STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"I heard the news!\p"
"They say you did excellent at\n"
"the {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"It's awesome, {STR_VAR_3} straight wins?\n"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""
"嗨！我是{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"我听说了！\p"
"听说你在{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"表现得非常出色。\p"
"{STR_VAR_3}连胜？太厉害了！\n"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1396
msgctxt "MatchCall_BattleFrontierStreakText2"
msgid ""
"Hello, it's {STR_VAR_1}!\n"
"I heard about you!\p"
"They said you won {STR_VAR_3} straight\n"
"battles at the {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"That's special! I should try\n"
"harder, too! See you!$"
msgstr ""
"你好，我是{STR_VAR_1}！\n"
"我听说你的事了！\p"
"听说你在{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"取得了{STR_VAR_3}连胜。\p"
"真了不起！我也得\n"
"更加努力才行！再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1404
msgctxt "MatchCall_BattleFrontierStreakText3"
msgid ""
"Hey there, {PLAYER}!\n"
"It's me, {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"I heard you went on a tear at\n"
"the {STR_VAR_2}!\p"
"A big {STR_VAR_3}-win streak…\n"
"That is a big record, isn't it?\p"
"I'd better get it together, too!\n"
"Catch you soon!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}！\n"
"是我，{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"听说你在{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"势如破竹！\p"
"足足{STR_VAR_3}连胜……\n"
"这可是了不起的纪录啊！\p"
"我也得加把劲了！\n"
"回头见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1414
msgctxt "MatchCall_BattleFrontierStreakText4"
msgid ""
"Hey, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1} here. What's up?\p"
"There's a rumor going around that\n"
"you strung together {STR_VAR_3} straight\l"
"wins at the {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
"I'd better step it up, too.\n"
"See you!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，{PLAYER}{KUN}。\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。最近怎么样？\p"
"有传闻说你在{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"取得了{STR_VAR_3}连胜。\p"
"我也得加把劲了。\n"
"再见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1423
msgctxt "MatchCall_BattleFrontierStreakText5"
msgid ""
"Hiya, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\n"
"It's {STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"You were at the {STR_VAR_2}\n"
"and won {STR_VAR_3} battles in a row?\l"
"Isn't that something!\p"
"I'd better work on my POKéMON more.\n"
"See you soon!$"
msgstr ""
"哈喽，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\n"
"我是{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"你在{STR_VAR_2}\n"
"连赢了{STR_VAR_3}场？\l"
"真了不起！\p"
"我得更用心培养宝可梦了。\n"
"待会儿见！$"

#: data/text/match_call.inc:1432
msgctxt "MatchCall_BattleFrontierStreakText6"
msgid ""
